QuestGuidance.Register("es",377,{
[12033]="7006C219\n1\tSearch among the ruins for signs of Namâkh\tSearch among the ruins for signs of Namâkh.\n2\tListen to Barûl\tListen to Barûl.\n",
[12034]="7006BF81\n1\tSearch Urmâkh for Namâkh's personal effects for clues as to Namâkh's location.\t\n2\tReturn to Niriga in Urmâkh\tReturn to Niriga with the items and report the location you found them.\n3\tSpeak with Niriga when you are ready to go\tSpeak with Niriga when you are ready to go.\n4\tComfort Niriga\tComfort Niriga as best you can.\n",
[12035]="7006C220\n1\tDefeat Barûl\tDefeat Barûl.\n2\tListen to Barûl and Niriga\tListen to Barûl and Niriga.\n3\tDefeat Barûl\tDefeat Barûl.\n4\tListen to Barûl\tListen to Barûl.\n5\tCheck on Namâkh\tCheck on Namâkh.\n",
[12036]="70043534\n1\tDerrota a la Espada Negra de Lebennin\030Defeat Upâl-keng\tDefeat the Black Blade of Lebennin before he can learn of Aragorn's gambit.\n",
[12037]="70043536\n1\tDerrota a la Espada Negra de Lebennin\030Defeat Upâl-keng\tDefeat the Black Blade of Lebennin before he can learn of Aragorn's gambit.\n",
[12038]="70049552\n1\tAid Dréri\030Aid Freki\030Aid Sversting\030Aid Spakorth\tSpakorth and his folk can be found within Lûghash. Spakorth has asked you to aid him and the other Stout-axes of Lûghash in easing the burdens laid upon them by Zôreth.\n2\tTalk to Spakorth in Lûghash\tSpakorth can be found within Lûghash in Dor Amarth. You have aided the Stout-axes of Lûghash in completing many of Zôreth's tasks and have also discovered the whereabouts of their imprisoned lord. You should now speak to Spakorth.\n",
[12039]="700622EA\n1\tHabla con Gorwen\tRhiangar te ha pedido que sigas los últimos pasos de Luilloth hasta Sarch Vorn. Ella desconoce el camino, pero sospecha que el montaraz Gorwen podría saber cómo llegar al lugar donde se encuentra la tumba. Deberías hablar con Gorwen en la caravana al sur de Andrath.\n2\tReúnete con Gorwen fuera de Sarch Vorn\tSarch Vorn se encuentra al oeste de la caravana de Gerwyn en Cardolan, y está construido sobre una colina de piedra negra. Deberías reunirte con Gorwen en la entrada de Sarch Vorn en Cardolan.\n3\tHabla con Gorwen\tGorwen se encuentra cerca de la entrada a Sarch Vorn. Sarch Vorn se encuentra al oeste de la caravana de Gerwyn en Cardolan, y está construido sobre una colina de piedra negra. Deberías hablar con Gorwen.\n4\tEntra en Sarch Vorn y busca algún rastro de Luilloth\tEs probable que los restos de Luilloth o algún otro indicio de sus aventuras de antaño se encuentren en algún lugar de Sarch Vorn. Deberías buscar algún indicio de Luilloth en Sarch Vorn.\n5\tAcaba con Luilloth en Sarch Vorn, la Tumba Negra\tLuilloth se encuentra en Sarch Vorn. Has descubierto los restos de Luilloth, animados por algún espíritu maligno en las profundidades de Sarch Vorn. Debes liberar a Luilloth del Miedo Gris y devolver sus restos al descanso eterno.\n6\tGorwen se encuentra en Sarch Vorn. Has liberado los restos de Luilloth del control del Miedo Gris. Deberías hablar con Gorwen.\t\n7\tAcaba con el Miedo Gris en Sarch Vorn, la Tumba Negra\tEl Miedo Gris se encuentra en Sarch Vorn. Debes derrotar al Miedo Gris en Sarch Vorn antes de que su maldad se extienda por Cardolan y las tierras de los Pueblos Libres.\n8\tGorwen se encuentra en Sarch Vorn. Has desterrado al Miedo Gris. Deberías hablar con Gorwen.\t\n9\tInvestiga la habitación de Luilloth en Sarch Vorn\tLa habitación de Luilloth se encuentra en Sarch Vorn. Tras expulsar al Miedo Gris, Gorwen ha oído un ruido que resonaba en los pasillos de Sarch Vorn. Debes volver con Luilloth.\n10\tHabla con Baya de Oro en Sarch Vorn\tBaya de Oro se encuentra en Sarch Vorn. Tras expulsar al Miedo Gris, descubriste que Baya de Oro también viajó a Sarch Vorn. Deberías hablar con Baya de Oro.\n11\tGorwen se encuentra en Sarch Vorn. Tras encontrarte con Baya de Oro en las profundidades de Sarch Vorn, has visto los restos de Luilloth descansando por fin en paz. Deberías hablar con Gorwen.\t\n12\tHabla con Rhiangar\tHas vencido al Miedo Gris y has dado descanso a los restos de Luilloth en Sarch Vorn. Ahora debes regresar con Rhiangar. Rhiangar se encuentra en la posada de Herne.\n",
[12040]="7000A8F6\n1\tDerrota a Guloth\tEl Cargûl Guloth está en el interior de Ost Elendil, más allá del puente de Ariant en el nivel superior de Annúminas. Legrindavor te ha advertido que Balhest está defendido por un temible Cargûl, llamado Guloth, que controla las criaturas de la sombra.\n",
[12041]="70044308\n1\tSpeak with Dúneth\tDúneth's camp is located in Talath Anor's eastern woods. You should speak with Dúneth at her camp.\n2\tTravel to Jal Kepir\tJal Kepir is located next to Cair Andros. You should travel to Jal Kepir in north-eastern Talath Anor.\n3\tDefeat enemies at Jal Kepir (total: 10)\tJal Kepir is located next to Cair Andros. You should defeat enemies at Jal Kepir.\n4\tSpeak with Dúneth\tDúneth can be found outside of Jal Kepir. You should speak with Dúneth.\n5\tSpeak with Tolwin\tSpeak with Tolwin.\n",
[12042]="7006025C\n1\tTalk to Uzvát outside Eiricháv\tEiricháv can be found in north west Câr Bronach. You should talk to Uzvát outside Eiricháv.\n2\tTalk to Rethvárd outside Eiricháv\tEiricháv can be found in north west Câr Bronach. You should talk to Rethvárd outside Eiricháv.\n3\tSeek out Brathar Crack-helm\tBrathar Crack-helm can be found just south of Agal Dûn in Câr Bronach. You should seek out Brathar Crack-helm.\n4\tTalk to Brathar Crack-helm\tBrathar Crack-helm can be found just south of Agal Dûn in Câr Bronach. You should seek out Brathar Crack-helm.\n5\tTravel to Agal Dûn\tAgal Dûn can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should travel to Agal Dûn.\n6\tDefeat foes at Agal Dûn (total: 12)\030Free a hillman\030Free another hillman\tAgal Dûn can be found in central Câr Bronach. You should defeat foes at Agal Dûn and rescue the two hillmen held as captives.\n7\tTalk to Múta at Agal Dûn\tMúta can be found at Agal Dûn. You should talk to Múta at Agal Dûn.\n",
[12043]="7006BB26\n1\tTalk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena\tRothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena. Speak to him.\n2\tDefeat the Tempestuous Flame\tWith Ragrekhûl's escape, a Tempestuous Flame has appeared within the arena. Defeat the creature so it does not cause additional damage and loss of life.\n3\tSecure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds\tDuring the commotion, members of the cult of the All-Seeing Eye have taken the opportunity to attack the city. With Ragrekhûl circling the Citadel of the Winds, you must now secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds.\n4\tDefeat the All-Seeing Eye cultists\tSecure the courtyard outside of the Citadel of the Winds.\n5\tDefeat Ragrekhûl\tRagrekhûl's rampage across Umbar has endangered the Umbari citizens. Defeat Ragrekhûl in the Courtyard of the Citadel of the Winds before more perish.\n",
[12044]="7006BB50\n1\tTalk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena\tRothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena. Speak to him.\n2\tDefeat the Tempestuous Flame\tWith Ragrekhûl's escape, a Tempestuous Flame has appeared within the arena. Defeat the creature so it does not cause additional damage and loss of life.\n3\tSecure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds\tDuring the commotion, members of the cult of the All-Seeing Eye have taken the opportunity to attack the city. With Ragrekhûl circling the Citadel of the Winds, you must now secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds.\n4\tDefeat the All-Seeing Eye cultists\tSecure the courtyard outside of the Citadel of the Winds.\n5\tDefeat Ragrekhûl\tRagrekhûl's rampage across Umbar has endangered the Umbari citizens. Defeat Ragrekhûl in the Courtyard of the Citadel of the Winds before more perish.\n",
[12045]="7006BB51\n1\tTalk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena\tRothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena. Speak to him.\n2\tDefeat the Tempestuous Flame\tWith Ragrekhûl's escape, a Tempestuous Flame has appeared within the arena. Defeat the creature so it does not cause additional damage and loss of life.\n3\tSecure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds\tDuring the commotion, members of the cult of the All-Seeing Eye have taken the opportunity to attack the city. With Ragrekhûl circling the Citadel of the Winds, you must now secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds.\n4\tDefeat the All-Seeing Eye cultists\tSecure the courtyard outside of the Citadels of the Winds.\n5\tDefeat Ragrekhûl\tRagrekhûl's rampage across Umbar has endangered the Umbari citizens. Defeat Ragrekhûl in the Courtyard of the Citadel of the Wind before more perish.\n",
[12046]="7006BB52\n1\tTalk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena\tRothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena. Speak to him.\n2\tDefeat the Tempestuous Flame\tWith Ragrekhûl's escape, a Tempestuous Flame has appeared within the arena. Defeat the creature so it does not cause additional damage and loss of life.\n3\tSecure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds\tDuring the commotion, members of the cult of the All-Seeing Eye have taken the opportunity to attack the city. With Ragrekhûl circling the Citadel of the Winds, you must now secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds.\n4\tDefeat the All-Seeing Eye cultists\tSecure the courtyard outside of the Citadel of the Winds.\n5\tDefeat Ragrekhûl\tRagrekhûl's rampage across Umbar has endangered the Umbari citizens. Defeat Ragrekhûl in the Courtyard of the Citadel of the Winds before more perish.\n",
[12047]="7006BB53\n1\tTalk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena\tRothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena. Speak to him.\n2\tDefeat the Tempestuous Flame\tWith Ragrekhûl's escape, a Tempestuous Flame has appeared within the arena. Defeat the creature so it does not cause additional damage and loss of life.\n3\tSecure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds\tDuring the commotion, members of the cult of the All-Seeing Eye have taken the opportunity to attack the city. With Ragrekhûl circling the Citadel of the Winds, you must now secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds.\n4\tDefeat the All-Seeing Eye cultists\tSecure the courtyard outside of the Citadel of the Winds.\n5\tDefeat Ragrekhûl\tRagrekhûl's rampage across Umbar has endangered the Umbari citizens. Defeat Ragrekhûl in the Courtyard of the Citadel of the Winds before more perish.\n",
[12048]="7006BB54\n1\tTalk to Rothog the Storm in the Arena\tRothog has summoned you to witness the unveiling of his latest spectacle for the Arena. Speak to him.\n2\tDefeat the Tempestuous Flame\tWith Ragrekhûl's escape, a Tempestuous Flame has appeared within the arena. Defeat the creature so it does not cause additional damage and loss of life.\n3\tSecure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds\tDuring the commotion, members of the cult of the All-Seeing Eye have taken the opportunity to attack the city. With Ragrekhûl circling the Citadel of the Winds, you must now secure the approach to the Citadel of the Winds.\n4\tDefeat the All-Seeing Eye cultists\tSecure the courtyard outside of the Citadel of the Winds.\n5\tDefeat Ragrekhûl\tRagrekhûl's rampage across Umbar has endangered the Umbari citizens. Defeat Ragrekhûl in the courtyard of the Citadel of the Winds before more perish.\n",
[12049]="70002D07\n1\tLleva el huevo de dragonzuelo a Arzhur\030Recolecta un huevo de dragonzuelo\tLa guarida de los dragonzuelos es Nád Nathair, al norte de Aughaire. Nád Nathair se reconoce no solo por los dragonzuelos sino por las muchas bestias de las colinas en la zona. El cantor de historias Arzhur te ha pedido que obtengas un huevo de dragonzuelo. El huevo se necesita como símbolo para que los hombres de Aughaire lo presenten a los otros clanes de las colinas. Te ha advertido que evites a los dragonzuelos al buscar el huevo.\n",
[12050]="700001A1\n1\tDestruye los huevos de dragonzuelo (total: 6)\tLa reina de los dragonzuelos y su nidada de huevos se encuentran en Urugarth, al oeste de Tármunn Sûrsa. Esmë te aconsejó destruir los huevos de la reina de los dragonzuelos.\n2\tHabla con Esmë\tEsmë está en Tármunn Súrsa, al este de Urugarth. Deberías regresar con Esmë para contarle tu éxito.\n",
[12051]="7005AB10\n1\tPick up 'The Drake-slayer'\030Defeat flying drakes with 'The Drake-slayer' (total: 7)\tScoutmaster Ausma has sent you a special crossbow to help you take down flying cold-drakes. You should use the Drake-slayer crossbow to defeat flying cold-drakes.\n2\tTalk to Hórin in Fellgát\tThe drake-slayer has lived up to its name! You should talk to Hórin in Fellgát after the battle is over.\n",
[12052]="7006625E\n1\tDefeat drakes in Belfalas (total: 4)\030Defeat drake matrons in Belfalas (total: 2)\tTherien has asked you to lessen the drake population in Belfalas. Drakes can be found in the countryside of Belfalas.\n2\tSpeak to Abartârik\tYou should let Abartârik know that you defeated drakes in Belfalas. Abartârik is in Dol Amroth.\n",
[12053]="70020A91\n1\tVacía toneles de la Liga de las Posadas (total: 7)\tLos toneles de la Liga de las Posadas pueden encontrarse repartidos por toda la Comarca. Deberías ir a El Pájaro y el Bebé en Cavada Grande, al Árbol de la Fiesta en Hobbiton, al Dragón Verde en Delagua, al Tronco Flotante en Los Ranales, a Casa del Bosque, a Bolgovado y a la Perca Dorada en Cepeda. Jónar ha insistido en que vacíes varios toneles de la Liga de las Posadas para sabotear a la liga de amantes de la cerveza, que crece demasiado rápido.\n2\tHabla con Jónar en la Mansión de Thorin\tJónar se encuentra en un rincón oscuro de la posada de la Mansión de Thorin. Deberías regresar de inmediato junto a Jónar para contarle las noticias de tu éxito contra los hobbits y su facción rival.\n",
[12054]="70039C6F\n1\tRecoge singonios (total: 5)\tLos Singonios crecen en la Frontera de los Pantanos, al este de Aldburg. El Thane Sparhafoc te ha pedido que entregues un mensaje a su hija Meregyth, pero primero quiere que recojas un ramo de Singonios para ayudar a suavizar la decepción que seguramente sentirá.\n2\tEncuentra a Meregyth\tMeregyth probablemente se encuentre justo al oeste del Salón del Hidromiel en Frontera de los Pantanos. Has reunido un impresionante ramo de singonios para darle a Meregyth. Ahora debes entregárselo junto con el mensaje del Thane Sparhafoc.\n3\tHabla con Meregyth\tMeregyth se encuentra en un muelle al oeste del Salón del Hidromiel de la Frontera de los Pantanos. Entrega el arreglo de Singonios y el mensaje de su padre, el Thane Sparhafoc, sobre la improbabilidad de que Éomer aún se case con ella ahora que es heredero al trono de Rohan.\n4\tHabla con el Thane Sparhafoc\tEl Thane Sparhafoc está en el Salón del Hidromiel de la Frontera de los Pantanos. Después de recibir las angustiosas noticias de su padre, una devastada Meregyth salió corriendo. Debes informar al Thane Sparhafoc que has entregado las desafortunadas noticias.\n",
[12055]="700408A1\n1\tLiquor can be found in the tavern of Lothgobel. You should quickly drink the liquor in the tavern to challenge Damkalb.\t\n2\tDrinks can be found in the tavern of Lothgobel in central Lamedon. You should drink quickly to best the drinking champion of Jajax's Corsairs.\t\n3\tDrinks can be found in the tavern of Lothgobel in central Lamedon. You should drink quickly to best the drinking champion of Jajax's Corsairs.\t\n4\tDrinks can be found in the tavern of Lothgobel in central Lamedon. You should drink quickly to best the drinking champion of Jajax's Corsairs.\t\n5\tDrinks can be found in the tavern of Lothgobel in central Lamedon. You should drink quickly to best the drinking champion of Jajax's Corsairs.\t\n6\tDrinks can be found in the tavern of Lothgobel in central Lamedon. You should drink quickly to best the drinking champion of Jajax's Corsairs.\t\n",
[12056]="7001BBA1\n1\tHabla con Laidhriel en el Bosque Ahogado\tLa segunda parte de la Hueste Dorada partió hacia el sur, hacia la zona anegada del bosque conocida como el Bosque Ahogado. Deberías buscar Estolad Mernael, el campamento de los elfos en el Bosque Ahogado, para que los elfos destinados en Troncosombríos puedan mantener la comunicación con sus hermanos cercanos.\n",
[12057]="7006EED8\n1\tSpeak with Nimasi in southern Imhûlar\tSpeak with Nimasi in southern Imhûlar.\n2\tExamine the banner Nimasi found\tExamine the banner Nimasi found.\n3\tLook for clues to the south-west\tFollow the bootprints that lead away from the banner south-west and see where they lead.\n4\tLook for clues you find and follow where they lead\tContinue following the bootprints that lead away from the banner south-west.\n5\tLook for clues you find to determine where they lead\tContinue following the bootprints that lead away from the banner north-west.\n6\tSpeak with Nimasi outside of the camp\tSpeak with Nimasi outside of the camp.\n",
[12058]="70044306\n1\tLook around the Grey Wood near the Púkel-men statue\030Look around the Grey Wood near the stream that cuts through the woods\tThe Grey Wood is west of Crithost. You should scout the edge of the Grey Wood for evidence of Orcs.\n2\tLook around the woods outside Crithost next to the Grey Woods\tThe Grey Wood is west of Crithost. You should scout the edge of the Grey Wood for evidence of Orcs.\n3\tRetrieve the strange staff\tThe strange staff can be found in the woods outside Crithost next to the Grey Wood. You should pick up the staff and bring it to Ceveneth.\n4\tSpeak with Ceveneth\tCeveneth can be found in the hall of Crithost. You should speak with Ceveneth.\n",
[12059]="70040419\n1\tClean messes left by the Corsairs\tMesses can be found in the store-house of Lothgobel. You should clean up the disgusting messes left behind by the drunken Corsairs.\n2\tClean messes (total: 4)\030Clean spills (total: 4)\tMesses can be found in the store-house of Lothgobel. You should clean up the disgusting messes left behind by the drunken Corsairs.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have cleaned up the devastating mess left by the drunken Corsairs in the store-house.\n",
[12060]="70062979\n1\tRecoge la botella de vino\tRhiangar te ha pedido que le lleves vino a su padre, el alcalde, y que intentes averiguar si ha pasado algo importante. El vino está en la cocina de la casa del alcalde, en Herne.\n2\tHabla con el alcalde Nevit\030Habla con Osian\tRhiangar te ha pedido que le lleves vino a su padre, el alcalde, y que intentes averiguar si hay algo importante. El alcalde está en la mesa del comedor, en su casa, en Herne.\n3\tHabla con Rhiangar\tDeberías contarle a Rhiangar lo que has averiguado de Osian y el alcalde. Rhiangar está en la cocina de la casa del alcalde, en Herne.\n4\tBusca el diario en la biblioteca\tRhiangar te ha pedido que le traigas el diario de su madre de la biblioteca. La biblioteca está en la casa del alcalde, en Herne.\n5\tLlévale el diario a Rhiangar\tDeberías llevar el diario a Rhiangar. Rhiangar está en la cocina de la casa del alcalde, en Herne.\n6\tHabla con Rhiangar\tMientras se cocina el guiso, Rhiangar te ha pedido que te reúnas con ella en la posada de Herne, La Posada de la Encrucijada.\n",
[12061]="7004B2DF\n1\tDefeat Counsellor Grárnath\030Defeat Forge-master Svartárn\030Defeat Dwarf-forgeworkers (total: 5)\tDwarves loyal to the Captain of the Pit can be found within Anglach: The Great Foundry. You should defeat Dwarf-forgeworkers and their leaders.\n",
[12062]="7004954E\n1\tPatrol the causeway towards Barad-dûr and search for the Dwarves of Mordor\tThe Dwarves of Mordor might be found somewhere along the causeway to Barad-dûr. Overjoyed that his kin have escaped Sauron's wrath, Gimli has asked you to search for the Dwarves of Mordor.\n2\tThe dwarves can be found at Blozronk along the causeway to Barad-dûr to the south-east of the Ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth. You have found a company of wounded dwarves in Dor Amarth. You should aid them as Gimli requested.\t\n3\tTalk to Spakorth at Blozronk\tSpakorth can be found at Blozronk in Dor Amarth. A dwarf named Spakorth has led the dwarves to the muddied waters of Blozronk. You should speak to him.\n",
[12063]="70000DE7\n1\tHabla con Ulfar\tUlfar está en los edificios de los enanos al norte de Ojo de Aguja. Para evitar enfadar a los enanos con acusaciones de robo, el frontero Redondo te pidió que obtuvieras la ayuda de los enanos a través de su capataz, Ulfar. Redondo cree que Ulfar podría señalar a cualquier posible ladrón entre los suyos.\n2\tLleva las órdenes a Ulfar\030Recoge las órdenes\tLos cazadores enanos merodean por las zonas norte y este del Pantano de los Juncos. El pantano se encuentra al sureste de Ojo de Aguja. Cuando le contaste a Ulfar la historia de la vaca de Filibert y la implicación de Olwir, no se sorprendió. Últimamente han pasado por Ojo de Aguja varios enanos de mala reputación, y Olwir parecía ser el peor de todos. Ulfar te ha pedido que consigas cartas de los cazadores enanos que sospecha que trabajan para Olwir.\n",
[12064]="700225EF\n1\tViaja a la estancia enana del Valle de Thrór\tLa estancia enana se halla en lo alto de un paso de montaña, al norte del río, en la ladera noroeste del Valle de Thrór. Dado que la nota advierte de una amenaza contra quienes habitan en las cumbres, tal vez convenga darles aviso.\n",
})
